it usually is..but even enabling experimental features doesn't bring the 
firewire options to my menu...it is not even there...infact there is no 
mention of it in teh config.in file in the alpha directory!!!

So i was able to get the option in to my interface by adding this line 
to the config.in file in /arch/alpha

source drivers/ieee1394/Config.in

it must be placed after an endmenu statement....

Well it is compiling the modules now with no problems..that seemed to do 
the trick....

John Weez







