no.  Tru64 only supports:
- Baseboard Audio (BBA) device on TURBOchannel bus machines.
- Microsoft Sound Board (MSB) audio device on machines with a PCI, EISA, or
ISA bus.

a MSB card can be *any* card that has the WSS (Windows Sound System)
chipset.  IO 530, IRQ 10 ,etc...

read the MME or MMS subset release notes on the Associated Products CD for
more info.

