them.  To me a serious problem would be a problem that prevents me from using
my system, like; I can't use my Hard Drives because of problems with the SCSI
driver, etc......

I just can not agree that they are serious unless they are either causing such a delay,
that they prevent me from using the system or filling up my HD with warning messages.

Seriously,


--George



