Hello Pedro,

It is already built into RH-7.2 for Alpha, it should just load by
default if you have not deviated from the standard install.

You may already be using the Feral driver.

When you type 'lsmod' do you see the
isp-mod  module loaded???

The simplest way is to just add an entry
to  /etc/modules.conf  like:

   alias scsi_hostadapter isp_mod

and update your intial ram disk with:

   mkinitrd -f -v --preload sd_mod --preload aic7xxx --preload sym53c8xx --preload isp-mod --preload jbd --preload ext3 /boot/initrd-2.4.9-32.5.img 2.4.9-32.5

I hope this helps.

Best Regards,


--George

