Try this:

Boot Linux.
As root, type 
	shutdown -h now
At SRM prompt, type 
	Set auto_action HALT

Now when you start, you will get the SRM prompt.

Then you can enter into the aboot prompt by using the approach mentioned
earlier (i.e., setting boot_osflags greater than the number of
