Alan Young wrote:
>  
> I applied it, but I still can not link regExport.  ld is now complaining
> about undefined references to $invoke_copy_to_stack..ng and
> $PrepareAndDispatch..ng.  It seems to be another twist on this issue.
> I see $invoke_copy_to_stack..ng defined in the source, but in the
> object, it's just a relocation record.

Ah, figured it out.  -O3 is in my compile options and that made the
compiler optimize out the routine even though the assembler code is
trying to reference it.  To fix it, I changed the Makefile in the
mozilla/xpcom/reflect/xptcall/src/md/unix directory to override with -O0,
deleted the object files in that directory and restarted the build.

